===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|en|id=noun|:inh|enm:care|tree=1}}
From {{inh|en|enm|care}}, from {{inh|en|ang|caru}}, {{m|ang|ċearu|t=care, concern, anxiety, sorrow, grief, trouble}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*karu}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*karō|t=care, sorrow, cry}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*ǵeh₂r-|t=shout, call}}. Cognate with {{cog|osx|cara}}, {{m|osx|kara|t=concern, action}}, {{cog|gmh|kar|t=sorrow, lamentation}}, {{cog|is|kör|t=sickbed}}, {{cog|got|𐌺𐌰𐍂𐌰|t=concern, care}}. Related also to {{cog|nl|karig|t=scanty}}, {{cog|de|karg|t=sparse, meagre, barren}}, {{cog|la|garriō}}, {{cog|grc|γῆρυς}}. See also {{l|en|chary}}.

